{
  "id": "pentane___density_and_specific_weight_vs__temperat",
  "title": "Pentane - Density and Specific Weight vs. Temperature",
  "description": "Calculator for estimating the density and specific weight of liquid pentane at given temperature. Outputs density in kg/m³, lb/ft³, lb/gal(US liq), and sl/ft³. Specific weight in N/m³ and lbf/ft³.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Pentane Density and Specific Weight Calculator\n\nThis calculator estimates the density and specific weight of liquid pentane at a given temperature.\n\n## Input Variables\nEnter the temperature value and select its unit below.\n\n## Output\nThe calculator returns:\n- **Density** in: kg/m³, lb/ft³, lb/gal(US liq), sl/ft³\n- **Specific weight** in: N/m³, lbf/ft³"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature_value",
          "label": "Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "temperature_unit",
          "label": "Temperature Unit",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Celsius (°C)",
              "value": "celsius"
            },
            {
              "label": "Fahrenheit (°F)",
              "value": "fahrenheit"
            },
            {
              "label": "Kelvin (K)",
              "value": "kelvin"
            },
            {
              "label": "Rankine (°R)",
              "value": "rankine"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "celsius"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "density_kg_m3",
          "label": "Density",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.temperature_unit === 'celsius' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * inputs.temperature_value) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'fahrenheit' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 32) / 1.8) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'kelvin' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 273.15)) : (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 491.67) / 1.8)"
        },
        {
          "id": "density_lb_ft3",
          "label": "Density",
          "unit": "lb/ft³",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(inputs.temperature_unit === 'celsius' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * inputs.temperature_value) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'fahrenheit' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 32) / 1.8) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'kelvin' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 273.15)) : (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 491.67) / 1.8)) * 0.06243"
        },
        {
          "id": "density_lb_gal_us",
          "label": "Density",
          "unit": "lb/gal(US liq)",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(inputs.temperature_unit === 'celsius' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * inputs.temperature_value) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'fahrenheit' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 32) / 1.8) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'kelvin' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 273.15)) : (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 491.67) / 1.8)) * 0.008345"
        },
        {
          "id": "density_sl_ft3",
          "label": "Density",
          "unit": "sl/ft³",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(inputs.temperature_unit === 'celsius' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * inputs.temperature_value) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'fahrenheit' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 32) / 1.8) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'kelvin' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 273.15)) : (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 491.67) / 1.8)) / 515.3788"
        },
        {
          "id": "specific_weight_n_m3",
          "label": "Specific Weight",
          "unit": "N/m³",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(inputs.temperature_unit === 'celsius' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * inputs.temperature_value) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'fahrenheit' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 32) / 1.8) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'kelvin' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 273.15)) : (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 491.67) / 1.8)) * 9.80665"
        },
        {
          "id": "specific_weight_lbf_ft3",
          "label": "Specific Weight",
          "unit": "lbf/ft³",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(inputs.temperature_unit === 'celsius' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * inputs.temperature_value) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'fahrenheit' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 32) / 1.8) : inputs.temperature_unit === 'kelvin' ? (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 273.15)) : (626.2 - 0.682 * (inputs.temperature_value - 491.67) / 1.8)) * 0.06243 * 0.3048"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}